Domain Name: NMG.com
OUs Created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security Groups Created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, IT-Users, Operation-Users
Purpose of each OU:
Finance - This department manages the organization's finances, including budgeting, financial planning, and routine spending
HR - This department manages the employee onboarding, offboarding, personnel matters, and compliance with employment policies and regulations
IT - This department provides technical support, manages IT-related tickets, and maintains the organization's technology and information security.
Operations - This department oversees the organization's day to day business operations and ensures that business processes run efficiently.
